      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈~哈哈哈！\n无论是独奏亦或是大混战都是我所渴望的！\n只有我才是井泉的继承者！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d754a76d5a467a0e1398b8203e08ffbf821be8cbbdb690162f7859722f69e8c5",
